ends on it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll also find yourself gaining special abilities as you advance further in the story. Invocation (INV) will be a special skill that can aid you in battle. What will you learn? How powerful will you become?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4292190/extras/2b7f9ce3fd897f88e9e2b747bfcdb648.avif?t=1773129097\" width=621 height=118 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Male or female character option</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro graphics, top-down</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open world to explore, in and outside the castle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modern lighting effects to provide dimly lit rooms and eerie streets at night</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Turn-based battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High replayability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Deck and Handheld Gaming PC Support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Windows + Linux via Wine/Proton</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "A cozy lovecraftian horror retro RPG. Become a paranormal investigator &amp; explore an open world. Solve a criminal conspiracy of the occult. Investigate &amp; battle monsters.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4292190/a0f41398a41ec06f7dc4cc2b9565e73d084db051/header.jpg?t=1773129097", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4292190/167ba76e677f6ab688a4c1db31181d03d73b4fc5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773129097", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4292190/167ba76e677f6ab688